# QA Scope

When the user asks to test, verify, validate, or check implementations:

- Delegate to the **fal-qa-engineer** subagent
- Invoke with: `/fal-qa-engineer` or "Use the fal-qa-engineer to..."

The QA engineer works across the full project and handles:

- Unit tests (`npm run test`)
- Playwright E2E (`npm run test:e2e`, `npm run seo:test:e2e`)
- Accessibility (`npm run test:a11y`)
- SEO verification (`npm run seo:verify`)
- Full verify pipeline (`npm run verify`)
